        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c45" parent="c37" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;arcSize=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;Ràng buộc toàn vẹn:&lt;/b&gt; FOREIGN KEY customers → devices → warranty_requests · NOT NULL trường bắt buộc (NFR04, BR04) · UNIQUE(warranty_requests.code) (BR05) · INDEX(customers.phone) → tra cứu ≤ 2s (NFR01) · INDEX(status, due_at) cho danh sách quản lý" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="890" x="170" y="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="c46" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=18;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;spacingRight=10;fontSize=12;" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:14px&quot;&gt;Yêu cầu → kiến trúc&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Chức năng&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• UC01/UC08 → CustomersController + CustomerLookupService&lt;br&gt;• UC02–UC05 → WarrantyRequestsController + Models (validations)&lt;br&gt;• UC06 → WarrantyRequestCreator + RequestCodeGenerator + SlaDeadlineCalculator&lt;br&gt;• UC07 → Manager::WarrantyRequestsController&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Phi chức năng&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• NFR01 (≤2s): index customers.phone&lt;br&gt;• NFR02 (≤3s): tạo yêu cầu trong 1 transaction, tính SLA tại server&lt;br&gt;• NFR03 (≥50 user): Puma multi-thread + connection pool PostgreSQL&lt;br&gt;• NFR04: validations Model + FK/NOT NULL ở DB&lt;br&gt;• NFR05: Devise (xác thực) + Pundit (phân quyền)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Quy tắc nghiệp vụ&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• BR01, BR07: phải tìm thấy KH mới cho tạo yêu cầu&lt;br&gt;• BR02–BR04: kiểm tra 2 lớp (client + server) và DB&lt;br&gt;• BR05: mã duy nhất + trạng thái &quot;Mới tiếp nhận&quot;&lt;br&gt;• BR06: due_at = created_at + giờ SLA theo ưu tiên&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Chú thích&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;━━ ▶ Request (gọi xuống)&lt;br&gt;- - ▶ Response (HTML / Turbo Stream)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="1190" width="340" x="1200" y="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
